      "description": {
        "fun": "Genesect was feared as the strongest of hunters some 300 million years ago, in the Paleozoic era, until Team Plasma revived it from a fossil and modified it, adding the cannon on its back. Slot in one of four Drives and its cannon fires blasts of water, electricity, fire or ice. It can fold into a disc-like flight configuration to soar at high speed, and it's said to be completely devoid of mercy.",
        "guide": "Genesect is a Bug- and Steel-type Mythical Pokémon, an ancient bug revived and modified by Team Plasma. Inserting a Drive into the cannon on its back changes the element of its attack.",
